      title: "Bluebird Coffee",
      content: "Bluebird Coffee is a bright corner cafe on Main Street with a good espresso machine, an overworked barista and a pastry case that empties by ten. A drip coffee costs three dollars; a latte costs about six. Half the town's business is conducted at its mismatched tables.",
